  "details": "The string 23339 `Move` is used both as:\n\n- Pushing the joystick\n\n- The avatar moving\n\nThis cannot usually be translated into the same word. Further, the two `Move`'s are also ambiguous in English.\n\n# Edit Nov. 7:\n\nWe intentionall used different translatrion for the two strings:\n\n- 23339 \"Move\" > \"推动\" (Red Box)\n\n- 23403 \"Move{ln}\" > \"控制移动\" (Blue Box)\n\nWhat we found out is: 23339 is used for both movements and control for movement \"Move\", while 23403 is used for the control for moving player camera \"Move\". I don't know if the two strings were intentionally split so that the control and action could be translated differently. If so, then the placement for the two strings are incorrect. If this is not the case, please somehow fix this still. <3",
